@baseUrl = http://localhost:7071/api
@adminToken = REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_TOKEN
@customerToken = REPLACE_WITH_CUSTOMER_TOKEN
@outletId = REPLACE_WITH_OUTLET_ID
@menuItemId = REPLACE_WITH_MENU_ITEM_ID
@tableNumber = REPLACE_WITH_TABLE_NUMBER

### Read current full settings before updating (admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/outlets/{{outletId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Pause delivery and counter sales; keep takeaway and QR/waiter dine-in enabled
### Copy the current full settings from GET above and change only the desired flags.
### PUT replaces settings: preserve actual hours, tax, delivery radius, and minimum amount.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/outlets/{{outletId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "settings": {
    "openingTime": "08:00",
    "closingTime": "22:00",
    "acceptsOnlineOrders": false,
    "acceptsTakeaway": true,
    "acceptsDineIn": true,
    "acceptsCounterSales": false,
    "taxPercentage": 5,
    "deliveryRadius": null,
    "minimumOrderAmount": null
  }
}

### Public channel availability (no authentication)
GET {{baseUrl}}/public/outlets

### Paused delivery is rejected with 409, even for an admin submitting the same order
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "outletId": "{{outletId}}",
  "orderType": "delivery",
  "items": [{ "menuItemId": "{{menuItemId}}", "quantity": 1 }],
  "deliveryAddress": "12 Station Road, Kanchrapara, West Bengal",
  "phoneNumber": "9000000000",
  "paymentMethod": "cash_at_counter"
}

### Paused counter sales are rejected with 409; existing invoice reprints are unaffected
POST {{baseUrl}}/counter-sales
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "outletId": "{{outletId}}",
  "items": [{ "menuItemId": "{{menuItemId}}", "quantity": 1 }],
  "paymentMethod": "cash_at_counter",
  "printInvoice": false
}

### After disabling acceptsDineIn, new waiter rounds are rejected with 409
### Repeat as a QR customer using the table QR/session headers to verify that path.
POST {{baseUrl}}/dine-in/order
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "outletId": "{{outletId}}",
  "tableNumber": "{{tableNumber}}",
  "items": [{ "menuItemId": "{{menuItemId}}", "quantity": 1 }]
}

### Non-admin changes must be rejected with 403 (use a customer-only account)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/outlets/{{outletId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "settings": { "acceptsOnlineOrders": false } }

### Admin: Clean outlet order history before keep-from date.
### This clears Orders (soft delete) and Dine-In Sessions (hard delete) before keepFromDate.
POST {{baseUrl}}/manage/orders/history/delete
Authorization: ******
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "outletCode": "MTC007",
  "keepFromDate": "26.10.26"
}
